    <briefdescription>
<para>Detects the NUMA topology of the current system. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Reads topology information from OS-provided interfaces:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Linux : /sys/devices/system/node/</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Windows: GetNumaNodeProcessorMaskEx / GetNumaAvailableMemoryNode</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>macOS : sysctl hw.packages (limited; typically 1 node)</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Results are cached after the first call. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
